machine-monitor · hub hub.lan:7777   1 Dashboard  2 Device  3 Processes         
1   dashboard    ↑/k  up           ←/h previous device                          
2   device       ↓/j  down         →/l next device                              
3   processes    pgup page up      K   move card earlier                        
tab next view    pgdn page down    J   move card later                          
?   help         g    top          R   rename device                            
q   quit         G    bottom       D   remove device                            
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
